# Line-ending policy.
#
# Every text file in this repo is stored LF in git (verified: 248/248 text
# blobs). The working tree drifted to CRLF during the project's Windows era,
# which made `git status` show all 213 text files as modified and hid the real
# changes among them. This file stops that recurring.
#
# Normalise on checkin, check out LF everywhere — including on Windows. The
# Electron toolchain, Node and Next.js are all LF-safe.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries — never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.icns   binary
*.webp   binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.pdf    binary
*.zip    binary
*.node   binary
*.db     binary
*.docx   binary
*.xlsx   binary

# Windows shell scripts genuinely need CRLF if any are ever added.
*.bat    text eol=crlf
*.cmd    text eol=crlf

# Generated — collapse in diffs and reviews.
package-lock.json  linguist-generated=true -diff
